  "reasoning": "The defendant Zhang deliberately caused the abandonment of his newborn twins by demanding the hospital cease treatment and handing the infants to a taxi driver to be left. Under Chinese criminal law, abandoning a minor under one's care constitutes the offense of abandonment (遗弃罪). No other distinct criminal conduct is described, so only this charge applies.",
